          ['Can I plan a Portuguese cultural event?', 'Only when Tourism Melaka or the event host publishes a current date and visitor guidance. The calendar checked on 12 October 2026 did not show a dated schedule, so no event or performance is promised here.'],
          ['What if the museum or onward ride is unavailable?', 'Keep Bandar Hilir as a shorter outdoor walk, return to the central riverfront for a verified indoor stop, and drop Ujong Pasir rather than improvising a late road trip.']
